# Where contact-form enquiries are forwarded.
#
# Any URL that accepts a JSON POST. The studio already runs Zapier and
# n8n, and either will take this and fan it out to email, Lark, a sheet
# or a CRM — which is why this is a webhook rather than a hard-coded
# email provider with an API key and a vendor decision attached.
#
# The body is:
#   { name, email, phone, company, need, message, receivedAt, source }
#
# WITH THIS UNSET the form does not pretend: it answers 503 and tells the
# visitor to email or call instead. The address and phone numbers sit
# beside the form for exactly that reason.
ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=
